# app-a is the learner's starting diff against the `skeleton` template
# (PLAN §6). It is empty here on purpose: this exercise's whole task is
# creating Sources/App/Controllers/GreetingController.swift, which the
# template doesn't ship, so there is nothing to pre-seed — the editor
# opens empty and the file comes into existence when they press Run.
#
# An exercise that starts from partially-written code puts that code here,
# at the same path it occupies in the project.
